  "title": "SpoilSafe: Imagine Cup Finalist Reducing Food Waste",
  "description": "SpoilSafe is an Azure-powered cold-chain intelligence platform that predicts food freshness in real time. Sensor data streams through Azure IoT Hub and is processed using Azure Data Explorer and Azure Synapse Analytics, while spoilage prediction models run on Azure AI Foundry. AI-driven insights help reduce food waste, improve safety, and enable smarter supply-chain decisions at scale.\n\nSeating for this session is first-come, first-served. Add it to your schedule to plan your day and arrive early to secure a spot.",
